            "review_title": "Review at My Mother Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pierre S\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam58 contributions\n0\nYou get much mor than what you pay for in other places\nDec 2018 • Friends\nOne of their 2 pax set menus at 950,000vnd included: glass of wine, starter, main and dessert. For that price you would expect average to low food. But no, it was very good.\nQuite place, nice staff. I will be back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 13, 2018",
