            "review_title": "Review at My Mother Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Connector785222\n1 contribution\n0\nLunch with colleagues\nJul 2018 • Business\nThe overall dining experience was pleasant. Service staff were knowledgeable and courteous. Food was good and the prices were decent. Of course if you were to compare the prices with other eateries My Mother Restaurant is slightly pricier because it offers a clean environment, table cloth settings and napkin. \nI would recommend this place if you are looking at local dishes with a touch of home cooking style.\nRead more\nWritten July 4, 2018",
