            "review_title": "Review at My Mother Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thanh Nhã V\n1 contribution\n0\nPLACE TO BACK YOUR HOMETOWN !\nMay 2018 • Friends\nIt's been a long time I've not yet back to my home town. Incidentally, I had a chance to came My Mother Restaurant with my co-worker and tried \"Southern - Northern Combo\" That's all of the dishes I used to eat when I was a child at my home town . Such homesick feeling!!!.\nThis is the reason why I recommend to you guys should come there if you want a corner of peace as home.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2018",
